{"id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-compositional-partial-truth.md","title":"Compositional Partial-Truth Interface","display":"df-compositional-partial-truth — Compositional Partial-Truth Interface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth","aliases":["67-df-compositional-partial-truth"],"display":"df-compositional-partial-truth — Compositional Partial-Truth Interface","depends_on":["[[67-df-hierarchy-interface]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]","[[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-compositional-partial-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compositional-partial-truth — Compositional Partial-Truth Interface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c8c1b19ad8b296f\" href=\"?note=7c8c1b19ad8b296f\" title=\"67-df-hierarchy-interface\">67-df-hierarchy-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea2f0556099a403a\" href=\"?note=ea2f0556099a403a\" title=\"67-df-partial-truth-definition\">67-df-partial-truth-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,D,\\gamma,c,r,b\">\\(g,D,\\gamma,c,r,b\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(U_{\\varepsilon,n})_{\\varepsilon&lt;2,n\\ge1}\">\\(U=(U_{\\varepsilon,n})_{\\varepsilon&lt;2,n\\ge1}\\)</span> 是候选二元算术公式族，指定自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,a\">\\(z,a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span> 在下式定义。使用本接口时明确假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span>，不从逐句正确性推断统一组合性质。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{h_c}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_3\">\\(e_{h_c}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{h_{\\operatorname{tm}}}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\">\\(e_{h_{\\operatorname{tm}}}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\\)</span> 分别实现下式的三元与一元零值检查函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(C_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span> 在下式是公式代码的识别公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(c_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span> 另限定为句子代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tm}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tm}\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Snt}\">\\(\\mathrm{Snt}\\)</span> 精确使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一个公式；代码函数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a>。</li>\n<li>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a>，因此其中的代码函数、有限列编码和项求值记号都有确定消去式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon,\\delta,n,m\">\\(\\varepsilon,\\delta,n,m\\)</span> 是元层参数；每个可证式中的数值变量显式绑定。</li>\n<li>对公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))\">\\(\\vec x=\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是与该变量表不同的新鲜变量。对象公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元程序之扩展函数符号，不将变量符号列本身当作自然数列编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nh_c(\\varepsilon,n,z)&amp;\\coloneqq1-c(\\varepsilon,n,z),&amp;h_{\\operatorname{tm}}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{tm}(z),\\\\\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{h_c}}(\\bar\\varepsilon,\\bar n,z,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{h_{\\operatorname{tm}}}}(z,0),\\\\\nc_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq C_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Snt}(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\bigl[U_{\\varepsilon,n}\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z,a]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\bar h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N,s_h\\models\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall t\\forall u\\forall a\\left(\n\\mathrm{Tm}(t)\\land\\mathrm{Tm}(u)\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{eq}(t,u),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{val}(t,a)=\\operatorname{val}(u,a)]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall z\\forall a\\left(C_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\to\n[U_{1-\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ng}(z),a)\\leftrightarrow\\neg U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall z\\forall w\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(w)\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{cn}(z,w),a)\\leftrightarrow\n(U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)\\land U_{\\varepsilon,n}(w,a))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall i\\forall z\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{al}(i,z))\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{al}(i,z),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall h\\,U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,h))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall i\\forall z\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ex}(i,z))\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ex}(i,z),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\,U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,h))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall\\vec x\\left[\nU_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}(\\vec x))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\right]\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall\\vec x\\left[\nU_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{sub}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\overline{b_{\\vec x}},\\operatorname{pack}_{|\\vec x|}(\\vec x)),0)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\right]\\right)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\delta&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall m\\ge n\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall z\\forall a\\left[\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\delta,m}(z)\\to\n(U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)\\leftrightarrow U_{\\delta,m}(z,a))\\right]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nh_c(\\varepsilon,n,z)&amp;\\coloneqq1-c(\\varepsilon,n,z),&amp;h_{\\operatorname{tm}}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{tm}(z),\\\\\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{h_c}}(\\bar\\varepsilon,\\bar n,z,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{h_{\\operatorname{tm}}}}(z,0),\\\\\nc_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq C_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Snt}(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\bigl[U_{\\varepsilon,n}\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z,a]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\bar h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N,s_h\\models\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall t\\forall u\\forall a\\left(\n\\mathrm{Tm}(t)\\land\\mathrm{Tm}(u)\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{eq}(t,u),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{val}(t,a)=\\operatorname{val}(u,a)]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall z\\forall a\\left(C_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\to\n[U_{1-\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ng}(z),a)\\leftrightarrow\\neg U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall z\\forall w\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(w)\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{cn}(z,w),a)\\leftrightarrow\n(U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)\\land U_{\\varepsilon,n}(w,a))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall i\\forall z\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{al}(i,z))\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{al}(i,z),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall h\\,U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,h))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall i\\forall z\\forall a\\left(\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ex}(i,z))\\to\n[U_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{ex}(i,z),a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\,U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,\\operatorname{upd}(a,i,h))]\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall\\vec x\\left[\nU_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\operatorname{assign}_{\\vec x}(\\vec x))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\right]\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D\\forall\\vec x\\left[\nU_{\\varepsilon,n}(\\operatorname{sub}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\overline{b_{\\vec x}},\\operatorname{pack}_{|\\vec x|}(\\vec x)),0)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\right]\\right)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\delta&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall m\\ge n\\\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall z\\forall a\\left[\nC_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land C_{\\delta,m}(z)\\to\n(U_{\\varepsilon,n}(z,a)\\leftrightarrow U_{\\delta,m}(z,a))\\right]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PartialTruth 仅表示逐句双条件，不足以固定代码层的组合行为。本条另列复杂度、标准模型正确性、原子、布尔、量词、数词代入以及层级一致性条件；它是明确的参数化接口，不把不存在的 Fact 10 文件当作定义。每个层级是单独的有限公式，没有引入一个对全部算术公式统一适用的全局真理谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-hierarchy-interface","status":"resolved","id":"7c8c1b19ad8b296f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-hierarchy-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partial-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"ea2f0556099a403a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","ancho